---
description: Map alternative repairs and their edition-wide consequences for editor choice.
args: { edition:SerialEdition; proposal:SerialScene; findings:ContinuityFinding[] }
returns: StoryRevision[]
---
For each conflict offer a proposal-local revision, an earlier seed/revision, and—only where author intent supports it—a canon amendment requiring editorial review. State voice and emotional intent to preserve, narrative tradeoffs, affected scenes and dependent knowledge events. Do not mutate the approved edition or select the least costly option as if it were authorial intent.
